1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,638
Water damage doesn't end when the water's gone.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,042
Done right, restoration follows one standard — measurable drying goals, not guesswork.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,177
Map the moisture.

4
00:00:13,177 --> 00:00:14,353
Set the dry goal.

5
00:00:14,353 --> 00:00:15,806
Verify every reading.

6
00:00:15,806 --> 00:00:17,329
Document the sign-off.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,926
That's the difference between dry, and dry to standard.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:27,969
Learn the method.

9
00:00:27,969 --> 00:00:29,794
Find an accredited professional.

10
00:00:29,794 --> 00:00:31,676
Restore it right, the first time.
